OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of AI company Anthropic has
OL,7,Fcalled for the pace of development of
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence models to slow
OL,9,Fdown and to be closely monitored.
OL,11,FIn an essay on Saturday, Dario Amodei
OL,12,Fsaid developing AI was not in question,
OL,13,Fbut the risks associated with it were
OL,14,F"serious" and companies and governments
OL,15,Fmust be given time to address them.
OL,17,FAmodei proposed a three-point plan that
OL,18,Fincludes independent monitoring of AI
OL,19,Fmodels as they are developed,
OL,20,Findustry-wide regulation and global
OL,21,Fregulation.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
