OL,3,APlayStation gambles with 18-rated
OL,4,AWolverine game - will it pay off?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, Sony will release Marvel's
OL,7,FWolverine - the biggest game exclusive
OL,8,Fto the PlayStation 5 this year.
OL,10,FIt's made by Insomniac, the studio
OL,11,Fresponsible for the recent Spider-Man
OL,12,Ftitles, which have sold 50 million
OL,13,Fcopies in recent years.
OL,15,FBut unlike the friendly neighbourhood
OL,16,Fsuperhero, Wolverine has a Pegi-18
OL,17,Frating in the UK, meaning a child
OL,18,Fcannot legally buy the game, and it
OL,19,Fcontains considerable levels of blood,
OL,20,Fgore and violence.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
